# Natural Movie fMRI Dataset (Raw, DeepPrep Derivatives, and Questionnaires)

This dataset contains naturalistic movie-watching fMRI data collected during three movie viewing conditions: movie1, movie2, and movie3.

## Dataset Contents

1. Raw Data (Dataset Root)
   - Structural (T1w) and functional fMRI raw BOLD images formatted according to BIDS standards.
   - Tasks included: movie1, movie2, and movie3.

2. Preprocessed Derivatives (derivatives/deepprep/)
   - Preprocessed functional MRI data generated using the DeepPrep preprocessing pipeline.
   - Functional images were spatially normalized to the MNI152NLin2009cAsym standard space.
   - Includes preprocessed BOLD time series and accompanying confound time series (timeseries.tsv/json).

3. Behavioral Data (sourcedata/)
   - Behavioral questionnaires are stored in the `sourcedata/questionnaire battery/` directory.

## Structure
The dataset strictly follows the Brain Imaging Data Structure (BIDS) v1.8.0 specification.